# Most datasets are NOT redistributed here (third-party terms); see README
# "Getting the data" and scripts/get_data.py.
#
# Exception: the Boiler Emulator dataset IS bundled. It is open access under
# CC BY (IEEE DataPort, doi:10.21227/awav-bn36) and is only 1.3 MB, so
# shipping it makes the Boiler results reproducible with no account or
# manual download. Attribution: dataset/BOILER_DATASET_LICENSE.md
dataset/*
!dataset/.gitkeep
!dataset/README.md
!dataset/BOILER_DATASET_LICENSE.md
!dataset/CHECKSUMS.sha256
!dataset/Boiler_emulator_dataset.csv

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Local run artifacts (results/*.json ARE tracked on purpose: they back the
# numbers reported in the manuscript. Logs and scratch output are not.)
*.log
*.pkl
output/
figures/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
